Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:37:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] Local map destinations: a right click on the street or
 dungeon plan sets one (or a quest's location); the trail only leads; the
 quest panel module goes

The held map's right press, when the sheet's own arm does not take it, asks the sheet where the place is from the player
(destinationAt) and announces it as mapPick; the sheet stands a flag there and a right click on the flag clears it. The pins
module turns the pick into the compass's mark, so the compass, waypoint and trail lead there. The guide trail loses its
way-back tier (F4 is on/off), and the quest-tracker module is removed: the game's own quest card is the one list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
